WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Automations tutorial: Repeatable work runs itself, within your limits.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.600
Page 1 of 4: Overview. What runs on its own, and what waits for you.

3
00:00:06.601 --> 00:00:11.206
The Automations overview shows what runs on its own, what is coming up and what needs your approval.

4
00:00:11.206 --> 00:00:15.241
Recent activity and the next scheduled action, with the time zone it runs in.

5
00:00:15.241 --> 00:00:21.947
Automations work on campaigns that already run in your connected ad accounts. One switch pauses them all.

6
00:00:21.947 --> 00:00:24.547
Page 2 of 4: Scheduler. Start, pause and change campaigns at set times.

7
00:00:27.165 --> 00:00:29.395
The Scheduler switches published campaigns on and off at set times, even when you are offline.

8
00:00:29.395 --> 00:00:36.960
A new schedule: choose the platform, the campaigns, and what should happen when.

9
00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:42.991
Times follow your time zone. Missed runs are skipped, never run late. (Closed without saving.)

10
00:00:42.991 --> 00:00:45.591
Page 3 of 4: Rules. Watch results, then notify, ask or act within limits.

11
00:00:48.203 --> 00:00:50.675
Rules watch your campaigns: spend, cost per result or return on ad spend.

12
00:00:50.675 --> 00:01:04.306
When a condition is met, a rule notifies you, asks first, or acts within the limit you set.

13
00:01:04.306 --> 00:01:06.906
Page 4 of 4: Activity. A record of every run, with the reason.

14
00:01:09.525 --> 00:01:14.965
Activity records everything your automations did, with the reason and the result.

15
00:01:14.965 --> 00:01:18.667
Nothing runs without a schedule or rule you switched on.
